      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Virginia–Carolina Railway, nicknamed the “Virginia Creeper,” extended to Todd in 1910, bringing slow but steady trains up steep grades.",
